WEBVTT

00:00:06.914 --> 00:00:09.166
You would never hurt him.

00:00:13.462 --> 00:00:15.964
[distorted] You would never hurt me.

00:00:17.257 --> 00:00:19.259
[Toothless cooing]

00:00:19.385 --> 00:00:21.303
How are you doing that?

00:00:21.512 --> 00:00:22.513
Please.

00:00:22.596 --> 00:00:24.556
You are my best friend, bud.

00:00:26.141 --> 00:00:27.351
[growling softly]

00:00:28.977 --> 00:00:30.813
My best friend.

00:00:36.402 --> 00:00:38.070
Atta boy! That's it!

00:00:38.445 --> 00:00:39.446
I'm here!

00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:40.739
[Drago] Enough!

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:42.533
[grunts]

00:00:45.494 --> 00:00:46.537
[exclaims]

00:00:47.496 --> 00:00:48.664
Hang on!

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:51.166
[Drago screaming]

00:00:52.167 --> 00:00:53.293
[grunts]

00:00:53.377 --> 00:00:54.545
Almost there, buddy.

00:01:05.180 --> 00:01:06.682
[Drago] Do something!

00:01:06.849 --> 00:01:08.559
We need to get those two apart.

00:01:19.570 --> 00:01:21.780
We gotta block him out, Toothless.

00:01:21.947 --> 00:01:22.948
Do you trust me, bud?

00:01:23.031 --> 00:01:24.032
[rumbles]

00:01:25.868 --> 00:01:27.703
We can do this.

00:01:27.995 --> 00:01:29.997
You and me.

00:01:30.372 --> 00:01:31.582
As one.

00:01:34.376 --> 00:01:35.377
That's it.

00:01:35.461 --> 00:01:37.963
Now let's try this one more time!

00:01:38.589 --> 00:01:39.882
[all cheering]

00:01:39.965 --> 00:01:41.675
Take him down, babe!

00:01:45.387 --> 00:01:46.555
Go get 'em!

00:01:48.891 --> 00:01:50.225
Take control of it!

00:01:52.853 --> 00:01:54.062
Shut it out, Toothless.

00:01:54.229 --> 00:01:55.772
-Stop them!
-Now!

00:01:59.776 --> 00:02:01.195
[laughing]

00:02:01.278 --> 00:02:02.279
[gasps]

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:07.201
[gasps]

00:02:07.659 --> 00:02:08.702
[grunting]

00:02:10.579 --> 00:02:11.830
[screams]

00:02:13.665 --> 00:02:15.292
[groaning]

00:02:19.296 --> 00:02:20.380
Not again.

00:02:22.382 --> 00:02:24.426
Toothless! It's now or never!

00:02:27.763 --> 00:02:29.097
Come on, bud! [grunts]

00:02:31.016 --> 00:02:32.100
Hold on!

00:02:35.270 --> 00:02:36.980
Yeah! We did it!

00:02:43.654 --> 00:02:44.655
[grunts]

00:02:44.738 --> 00:02:45.864
[shouts]

00:02:46.198 --> 00:02:48.283
[Hiccup] Hold him there, Toothless.

00:02:48.617 --> 00:02:50.452
It's all over now.

00:02:52.079 --> 00:02:53.455
Or is it?

00:02:55.415 --> 00:02:56.458
Uh…

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:58.001
Oh, no!

00:02:58.085 --> 00:02:59.461
[screams]

00:03:04.299 --> 00:03:05.717
[chuckles]

00:03:06.885 --> 00:03:07.886
No!

00:03:09.972 --> 00:03:10.973
No!

00:03:11.265 --> 00:03:12.558
[grunting]

00:03:19.147 --> 00:03:20.357
Hiccup!

00:03:20.440 --> 00:03:21.650
[ice cracking]

00:03:21.733 --> 00:03:22.734
[gasps]

00:03:29.324 --> 00:03:30.867
[all exclaiming]

00:03:35.914 --> 00:03:37.541
[roaring]

00:03:40.711 --> 00:03:42.045
[panting]

00:03:51.346 --> 00:03:52.723
He's challenging the alpha!

00:03:52.889 --> 00:03:54.391
To protect you.

00:04:12.242 --> 00:04:13.702
[roars]

00:04:20.292 --> 00:04:22.252
No, no, no! No!

00:04:23.378 --> 00:04:25.213
Fight back! Fight!

00:04:25.380 --> 00:04:26.798
Fight!

00:04:29.134 --> 00:04:31.553
What's the matter with you?

00:04:35.265 --> 00:04:37.225
[people murmuring]

00:04:41.647 --> 00:04:42.898
Now do you get it?

00:04:43.106 --> 00:04:46.485
This is what it is to
earn a dragon's loyalty.

00:04:46.568 --> 00:04:48.403
[pants]

00:04:48.487 --> 00:04:50.238
Let this end. Now.

00:04:50.781 --> 00:04:51.948
Never!

00:04:52.074 --> 00:04:53.075
Come on!

00:04:53.784 --> 00:04:55.077
[roars]

00:05:11.259 --> 00:05:12.678
Ah! [grunts]

00:05:16.014 --> 00:05:17.307
Fight!

00:05:21.978 --> 00:05:23.355
[yells]

00:05:28.026 --> 00:05:29.444
[bellowing]

00:05:41.790 --> 00:05:42.999
[roaring]

00:05:47.963 --> 00:05:49.631
[groaning]

00:05:51.007 --> 00:05:53.552
The alpha protects them all.

00:05:53.635 --> 00:05:55.554
[grunting]

00:05:59.808 --> 00:06:01.268
[all cheering]

00:06:13.363 --> 00:06:14.990
[cheering continues]

